	description="Free button mapping detection tool. See the exact index your PC assigns to every button and axis on your controller, with a live event log."
>


	<div class="header">
		<h1>Button Mapping Detection</h1>
		<p>Verify exactly which physical button triggers which hardware index to diagnose mapping and driver issues.</p>
	</div>

