			</div>

			<div class="info-tip">
				<strong>How to use:</strong> Press any physical button on your controller. Observe which area lights up on screen and its corresponding index number. If the lit area doesn't match the button you pressed, there may be a mapping modification or driver issue.
			</div>
		</div>

		<div class="right-col">
			<div class="panel log-panel">
